---
title: Sponsor Application
layout: base.njk
permalink: /sponsor-application/index.html
---
<div class="page-hero">
  <h1>Sponsor Application</h1>
  <p>Seeking sponsors for Peace Islands Institute Boston: be a pillar of change</p>
</div>
<div class="wrap">
  <section class="prose narrow">
    <h3>Sponsorship Levels</h3>
    <p><strong>Platinum Sponsor ($5,000)</strong> — prominent logo placement on event materials, website, and promotional materials; exclusive naming rights for select events; keynote speaking opportunities; premier booth/exhibit space; extensive media coverage; special recognition at ceremonies.</p>
    <p><strong>Gold Sponsor ($3,000)</strong> — logo placement on materials and website; recognition in press releases; speaking opportunities at specific events; premium booth space; inclusion in social media campaigns.</p>
    <p><strong>Silver Sponsor ($2,000)</strong> — logo placement on materials and website; recognition in select press releases; booth space at events; inclusion in social campaigns.</p>
    <p><strong>Bronze Sponsor ($1,000)</strong> — logo placement on materials and website; booth space at events; acknowledgment in select promotional materials.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <form name="sponsor-application" method="POST" action="/thank-you/" enctype="multipart/form-data" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" class="site-form narrow">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="sponsor-application">
      <p hidden><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
      <label>Your name<input type="text" name="name" required></label>
      <label>Name of the organization<input type="text" name="organization" required></label>
      <label>Your cell phone<input type="tel" name="phone"></label>
      <label>Your permanent address<input type="text" name="address"></label>
      <label>How did you hear about us?
        <select name="heard_about">
          <option>Walk-In</option>
          <option>Employee</option>
          <option>Newspaper Ad</option>
          <option>Facebook</option>
          <option>Other</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>Sponsorship level
        <select name="sponsorship_level" required>
          <option>Platinum Sponsor ($5000)</option>
          <option>Gold Sponsor ($3000)</option>
          <option>Silver Sponsor ($2000)</option>
          <option>Bronze Sponsor ($1000)</option>
          <option>Customized Sponsorship</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>Elaborate if you chose "Customized Sponsorship"<textarea name="customized_details" rows="4"></textarea></label>
      <label>Sponsorship duration
        <span class="field-hint">Desired start and end dates, if applicable</span>
        <input type="text" name="duration" placeholder="e.g. June 2026 – June 2027">
      </label>
      <label>Sponsorship proposal
        <span class="field-hint">Upload a document outlining the benefits and offerings you'd like to provide as a sponsor</span>
        <input type="file" name="proposal_file" accept=".pdf,.doc,.docx,image/*" required>
      </label>
      <label>Additional information<textarea name="additional_info" rows="4"></textarea></label>
      <button class="btn btn-gold" type="submit">Submit Application</button>
    </form>
  </section>
</div>
